            <p></p><h3>The Next Era of Second Life Restraint &amp; FinDom Technology</h3><p></p><p>We are proud to announce the official release of the <strong>[Control &amp; Chaos] Vow Collar Standalone Edition</strong>.</p><p>Engineered from the ground up for zero script delay, the 2026 Vow Collar integrates deep into the Control &amp; Chaos ecosystem while operating as an elite standalone collar for any region in Second Life.</p><p></p><h3>Key Capabilities</h3><p></p><p></p><ul><li><strong>Ultra-Fast LinksetData Storage</strong>: Instantly saves owner passkeys, titler badges, and RLV permission states with sub-millisecond memory execution.</li><br><li><strong>Experience Stealth Auto-Attach Props</strong>: Ballgags, posture locks, and heavy steel muzzle props attach seamlessly via region Experience permissions without consuming inventory attachment lag.</li><br><li><strong>Automated Recurring Air Taxes</strong>: Set compounding tribute debits, tax cycles, and late-fee interest penalties directly from the Domme HUD.</li><br><li><strong>Native llDialog &amp; Web HUD Control</strong>: Manage your collared submissive in-world with low-lag native dialogs or launch the luxury Web App companion.</li></ul><p></p><p>Visit Control &amp; Chaos or check out the official <a href="/index.html">Vow Collar Web Guide</a> for setup instructions.</p>
